      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T20:49:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ah, brilliant --- i\u0027ll stop trying to convince you of your existing position then :-)",
      "parentUuid": "829d1e1c_ec416e5a",
      "revId": "80f2f58a9b6528567eca0770394d24c369085021",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c5ba4bc9_0d928147",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003224
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T20:49:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "(in that case, if we\u0027re not making async any more common than it already is, i don\u0027t care that much. i still think a \"hey, consider upgrading to the way better option that would have helped with this bug you just hit!\" message would make more sense though.)",
      "revId": "80f2f58a9b6528567eca0770394d24c369085021",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
